@startuml
!include ../_style.puml
left to right direction
rectangle "1 In the process: temporary storage (KVS) or file buffer" as L1
rectangle "2 Handed to the OS or the flash driver: page cache, file system journal" as L2
rectangle "3 Physically on the medium" as L3
L1 --> L2 : SyncToStorage, SyncToFile, close
L2 --> L3 : fsync, file system commit, device cache flush
@enduml
